<title>AUSTRIA: Brau Union to pay unchanged 1996 div.</title>
<headline>Brau Union to pay unchanged 1996 div.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian brewer Brau Union, a unit of drinks group BBAG, will pay an unchanged dividend of 23 schillings per share for 1996, BBAG said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BBAG Chief Executive Johannes Brandl announced the flat dividend payment during a news conference on BBAG's 1996 earnings. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
